# Card Studio config. Every value here is ALSO editable live in the Settings tab;
# this file just sets the defaults the app boots with.
#
# The OpenRouter API key is resolved at call time, in this order:
#   1. a key saved in the Settings tab  (workspace/settings.json)
#   2. OPENROUTER_API_KEY in the environment
#   3. the sibling Build #2 .env  (../02-desktop-companion/.env)
# So if you already put your key in Build #2, the studio finds it — nothing to do.

# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...

# Models (edit freely in Settings — model ids drift). Defaults are uncensored so
# they won't refuse to help write an adult companion (→ book ch. 06 §9).
# ASSIST_MODEL=thedrummer/cydonia-24b-v4.1
# CHAT_MODEL=thedrummer/cydonia-24b-v4.1
# IMAGE_MODEL=google/gemini-2.5-flash-image
